hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1558","We are Al-Hasan bin Muhammad, we are Yazid, meaning the son of Harun, Al-Dastawi told us. H Al-Hasan also told us, Abdullah bin Bakr told us, Hisham told us. H, Salam bin Junada, narrated to us, Waki`, on the authority of Hisham al-Dastawai, on the authority of Yahya bin Abi Kathir, on the authority of Muhammad bin Ibrahim, on the authority of Khaled bin Maadan, on the authority of Al-Irbad bin Sariyah, said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “used to ask forgiveness for the three in front of the row, and for the second.” \"once\""
